{"title":"레인의 세계","artist":"Sound Horizon","sourceId":"reference:zd72wU1FgDODA0CKJJs3","sourceHash":"a887d853fd61ed234dfaf6492270cee69f4b6313c3e8ce3e291ae7c009415466","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":17655784,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":3.42,"end":7.39,"text":"荒れ果てた野を 一人の少女が往く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":7.39,"end":9.96,"text":"正確には 一人と一匹","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":9.96,"end":12.73,"text":"少女の右手には 赤い紐","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":12.73,"end":16.42,"text":"その先に結ばれたる 首輪もまた赤く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":16.42,"end":20.54,"text":"黒銀の毛並みを持つ犬は 小さく吠えた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":20.54,"end":22.69,"text":"飼い主たる少女","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":22.69,"end":25.3,"text":"『澪音』に語りかけるかのように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":39.84,"end":43.38,"text":"豪奢な廃墟に 転がり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":43.38,"end":46.75,"text":"冷たい雨に 怯える","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":46.75,"end":50.54,"text":"輝ける 名誉も 権力(ちから)も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":50.54,"end":54.3,"text":"今では もう 過去の 所有物(もの)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":54.3,"end":57.8,"text":"観測とは 事実の側面を 抉り取る 刃物(ナイフ)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":57.8,"end":61.75,"text":"その男は 果たして... 何を得... 何を失ったのか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":61.75,"end":65.44,"text":"奪いし物は 奪われ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":65.44,"end":68.62,"text":"斯(かく)して 世界は 廻(まわ)る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":68.62,"end":72.34,"text":"降り止まない 雨の向こうに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":72.34,"end":76.07,"text":"何色の空をみる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":76.07,"end":79.45,"text":"代償(リスク)を 背負うほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":79.45,"end":83.15,"text":"加熱する 駆け引きは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":83.15,"end":86.81,"text":"全て失くすまで 気付かない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":86.81,"end":90.95,"text":"度し難い 自我(エゴ)の下僕","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":105.67,"end":109.00999999999999,"text":"空虚な廃墟に 転がり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":109.00999999999999,"end":112.78999999999999,"text":"冷たい雨に 震える","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":112.78999999999999,"end":116.47,"text":"帰る場所も 待ってる人も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":116.47,"end":120.09,"text":"今では もう 過去の 支配領域(ばしょ)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":120.09,"end":123.97,"text":"推測とは 事実の背面を 削ぎ落とす 刃物(ナイフ)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":123.97,"end":127.52,"text":"その男は 果たして... 何を見... 何を悟ったのか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":127.52,"end":130.92,"text":"奪いし者は 奪われ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":130.92,"end":134.68,"text":"斯(かく)して 時代は 廻(めぐ)る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":134.68,"end":138.27,"text":"降り止まない 雨の向こうに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":138.27,"end":141.95,"text":"何色の空がある","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":141.95,"end":145.37,"text":"運命を 捩じ伏せ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":145.37,"end":149.01,"text":"従える 心算(つもり)でも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":149.01,"end":152.67000000000002,"text":"未来(とき)を掴もうと 伸ばした","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":152.67000000000002,"end":156.68,"text":"その腕では 短か過ぎた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":156.68,"end":160.26,"text":"閉ざされた 少女の瞳が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":160.26,"end":163.65,"text":"開かれし 瞬間(とき) 世界は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":163.65,"end":167.24,"text":"幻想し得る 最悪の 狂夢(ゆめ)を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":167.24,"end":171.55,"text":"残酷な 死神(かみ)を見る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":171.55,"end":173.31,"text":"(澪音の世界)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":173.31,"end":176.19,"text":"『死』とは... 精神(こころ)に先行して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":176.19,"end":181.74,"text":"まず 肉体(からだ)に依存する感覚から 朽ち果てるものらしい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":181.74,"end":187.19,"text":"なればこそ 人間(ひと)は散々 忌避し 逃避を企てながらも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":187.19,"end":192.93,"text":"招かれざる 死の冷たい 接吻(口付け)に 耐え得るのだろうか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":192.93,"end":198.28,"text":"絶え間ない恐怖感が 雨となり 降り続けるという 幻想","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":198.28,"end":203.31,"text":"それは... 生きながらにして 精神(こころ)を壊されてゆく 苦痛","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":203.31,"end":208.47,"text":"硝子球のように透き通った 永遠の合わせ鏡","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":208.47,"end":215.16,"text":"罪人は 少女の瞳の中に 唯『世界』を見るという","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":215.16,"end":219.27,"text":"百聞は一見に如かず 千聞とてまた然り","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":219.27,"end":225.62,"text":"憐憫... 侮蔑... 的外れな嘲笑... 謂わば対岸の火事","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":225.62,"end":230.55,"text":"燃えるまでは 熱さ解らず 燃えてからでは 遅過ぎる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":230.55,"end":237.53,"text":"この世界で 何人(なんぴと)が罪を犯さずに 生きられると言うのか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":237.53,"end":240.66,"text":"(澪音の世界)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":256.22,"end":259.64,"text":"閉ざされた 少女の瞳が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":259.64,"end":263.21,"text":"開かれし 瞬間(とき) 世界は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":263.21,"end":266.6,"text":"幻想し得る 最悪の 狂夢(ゆめ)を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":266.6,"end":270.52,"text":"残酷な 死神(かみ)を見る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":270.52,"end":274.12,"text":"薄氷色(アイスブルー)に 煌く瞳が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":274.12,"end":277.53,"text":"鮮やかに 朽ちる世界と","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":277.53,"end":281.3,"text":"堕ちてゆく 狂夢(ゆめ)に 唇を重ねて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":281.3,"end":285.49,"text":"残酷な 死神(かみ)になる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":285.49,"end":289.08,"text":"地に蔓延りし 我ら罪人の群れ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":289.08,"end":290.95,"text":"願わくば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":290.95,"end":296.2,"text":"君が 澪音の世界に 囚われないことを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}